    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Ciaphas Cain",
    "summary": "This unit must be deployed in the Deploy Armies step, either on the battlefield or inside a **TRANSPORT** unit deployed on the battlefield. Neither this unit nor a **TRANSPORT** it is embarked within can be affected by abilities that redeploy units or put them into **Strategic Reserves**.",
